{:event/actor "seb" :event/at #inst "2026-08-06T19:55:25.493Z" :event/body {:fact/path [:summary] :fact/value "Give the evidence bundle a named, versioned on-disk format with compatibility rules, then build a service that re-derives a bundle per request and renders a badge naming the derivation (stage reached, guards satisfied, definition hash) rather than a compliance verdict. Grounded in the real bundle at github.com/metio/tik releases 2026.8.6132954; the de-facto format today is tik bundle / tik import / bundle-verify-sh in cli/tik/audit.clj. Design is in docs/IDEAS.md, section 'A published evidence-bundle format, and a service that re-derives it'."} :event/parents #{"sha256-9398ca1203a7d3e49da3596c1627963c6e9166b5faa05466d15e2e48fc9b6740"} :event/ticket #uuid "80e64ab6-b259-4c8a-8343-dda33ae9fc7d" :event/type :fact/assert}